                "text": "The minority witness, Shana Verstegen, a fellow Wisconsinite, is a victim of Obamacare\u2019s soaring premiums and perverse incentives causing employers to drop coverage and force their employees on to the unaffordable exchanges. https://t.co/lX23UZqEH0",
