                "retweet_count": 1924,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Here are the charts I presented at my hearing last week, titled \u201cAssessing the Damage Done by Obamacare.\u201d\n\nThe first chart shows the state-by-state percent increase in premiums on Obamacare exchanges since its implementation \u2014 an average 169% increase, 4.3 times the rate of inflation. \n\nBy comparison, the average percent increase of employer-sponsored insurance is less than half of that at 74% \u2014 1.9 times the rate of inflation.\u00a0\n\nObamacare is a DISASTER.",
                "text_lang": "en",
